  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 69 + 15 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (48 ÷ 3) = 58\n\nOption 1) 4 and 2\n\n69 + 15 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (48 ÷ 3) = 58 ⇒ 69 + 15 − (14 × 2 ) ÷ 4 + (48 ÷ 3) = 58\n\n⇒ 69 + 15 − __**(14 × 2 )**__ ÷ 4 + __**(48 ÷ 3)**__ = 58 \n\n⇒ 69 + 15 − __**28 ÷ 4**__ + 16 = 58\n\n⇒ __**69 + 15 + 16**__ − 7 = 58\n\n⇒ __**100 - 7**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 48 and 15\n\n69 + 15 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (48 ÷ 3) = 58 ⇒ 69 + 48 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (15 ÷ 3) = 58\n\n⇒ 69 + 48 − __**(14 × 4 )**__ ÷ 2 + __**(15 ÷ 3)**__ = 58 \n\n⇒ 69 + 48 − __**56 ÷ 2**__ + 5 = 58\n\n⇒ __69 + 48 + 5__ − 28 = 58\n\n⇒ __122 - 28__ = 58\n\n⇒ 94 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 69 and 48\n\n69 + 15 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (48 ÷ 3) = 58 ⇒ 48 + 15 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (69 ÷ 3) = 58\n\n⇒ 48 + 15 − __**(14 × 4 )**__ ÷ 2 + __**(69 ÷ 3)**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 48 + 15 − __**56 ÷ 2**__ + 23 = 58 \n\n⇒ __48 + 15 + 23__ − 28 = 58\n\n⇒ __86 - 28__ = 58\n\n**⇒ 58 = 58 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 3 and 4\n\n69 + 15 − (14 × 4 ) ÷ 2 + (48 ÷ 3) = 58 ⇒ 69 + 15 − (14 × 3 ) ÷ 2 + (48 ÷ 4) = 58\n\n⇒ 69 + 15 − __**(14 × 3 )**__ ÷ 2 + __**(48 ÷ 4)**__ = 58 \n\n⇒ 69 + 15 − __**42 ÷ 2**__ + 12 = 58\n\n⇒ __69 + 15 + 12__ − 21 = 58\n\n⇒ __96 - 12__ = 58\n\n⇒ 84 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
